# Everything in this directory is downloaded or generated by
# prepare_reference.sh: the full hg38 FASTA, bowtie2/STAR/Bisulfite
# indices, the chr21 subset reference + annotation, the miRBase FASTA,
# and the subsetted test reads. All of it is large and reproducible, so
# ignore the directory contents by default and track only the prep
# script, its manifest, and this ignore file.
*
!.gitignore
!prepare_reference.sh
!prep_manifest.tsv
